OL,4,BSpurs' Savio to miss festive fixtures  
OL,5,Bafter injury setback                   
OL,6,GTottenham winger Savio will miss the   
OL,7,Gclub's Christmas fixtures with injury  
OL,8,Gand could be out for up to 80 days,    
OL,9,Gmanager Roberto de Zerbi has confirmed.
OL,11,FSavio joined Spurs from Manchester     
OL,12,FCity for #75m this summer, but has     
OL,13,Fplayed in just five of their 11        
OL,14,FPremier League matches this season.    
OL,16,FThe 22-year-old came on as a           
OL,17,Fsubstitute in the 64th minute of       
OL,18,FTottenham's 2-0 win over Ipswich on    
OL,19,FSaturday, but was forced off with two  
OL,20,Fminutes remaining with a hamstring     
OL,21,Finjury.                                
